{"seq":1,"slug":"topup-channel-clearing-model","title":"充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/wallet-lifecycle-topup-withdraw/topup-channel-clearing-model","wordCount":3075,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型\">充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型</h1><p>买家在收银台点下「支付成功」的那一刻，平台钱包并不是把钱「收到」了——它只是拿到了一个承诺。真正落进平台银行户头的资金，要等到渠道按自身的清算周期把净额打过来，可能是几分钟（PIX、UPI），也可能是 T+2 个工作日之后（国际卡组织）。这段「承诺已存在、钱还没到」的时间窗口，就是充值业务里风险最集中、账最难平的地方。本文把这段窗口显式建模成一个<strong>待清算在途账户</strong>（pending-clearing / funds-in-transit account），让复式账本从充值的第 0 秒起就自洽，而不是等到银行对账单到了再回头补记。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>充值的本质是<strong>外部资金跨边界进入平台负债体系</strong>。平台对买家承担一笔可提现或可消费的负债，而平台自己手上拿到的是对渠道的一笔应收权利。这两者之间存在时间错配，因此必须用两个不同的账户承接：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用户钱包负债账户</strong>：平台欠买家的钱，记在负债侧，随充值可用余额增加。</li>\n<li><strong>待清算在途账户（应收渠道款）</strong>：平台对支付渠道的应收权利，记在资产侧；资金真正到账后，从在途账户结转到已清算银行账户。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果直接把充值记成「借：银行存款」，账本就在说谎——银行户头里当时并没有这笔钱。正确做法是先借在途、后结转，中间的差额和手续费在结转时一次性入账。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[买家发起充值 100 USD] --&gt; B[渠道受理&lt;br/&gt;授权/扣款请求]&#10;    B --&gt; C{授权结果}&#10;    C --&gt;|成功| D[待清算在途账户&lt;br/&gt;借:应收渠道款 100]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用户钱包负债&lt;br/&gt;贷:用户余额 100]&#10;    C --&gt;|失败| F[终态 FAILED&lt;br/&gt;不产生分录]&#10;    E --&gt; G[渠道按清算周期结算&lt;br/&gt;净额打款到平台银行户]&#10;    G --&gt; H[结转分录&lt;br/&gt;借:银行存款 97.1&lt;br/&gt;借:手续费 2.9&lt;br/&gt;贷:应收渠道款 100]&#10;    H --&gt; I[结算批次逐笔核销&lt;br/&gt;差异挂账人工处置]\">flowchart TD\n    A[买家发起充值 100 USD] --&gt; B[渠道受理&lt;br/&gt;授权/扣款请求]\n    B --&gt; C{授权结果}\n    C --&gt;|成功| D[待清算在途账户&lt;br/&gt;借:应收渠道款 100]\n    D --&gt; E[用户钱包负债&lt;br/&gt;贷:用户余额 100]\n    C --&gt;|失败| F[终态 FAILED&lt;br/&gt;不产生分录]\n    E --&gt; G[渠道按清算周期结算&lt;br/&gt;净额打款到平台银行户]\n    G --&gt; H[结转分录&lt;br/&gt;借:银行存款 97.1&lt;br/&gt;借:手续费 2.9&lt;br/&gt;贷:应收渠道款 100]\n    H --&gt; I[结算批次逐笔核销&lt;br/&gt;差异挂账人工处置]</pre><p>在途账户的记账方向决定了「用户何时拿到可用余额」这一产品决策，两种主流策略的取舍是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>记账时机</th>\n<th>用户可用余额</th>\n<th>承担的风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>垫资即时到账（instant credit）</td>\n<td>渠道授权成功即贷记用户余额</td>\n<td>立即可用</td>\n<td>平台承担渠道最终失败/拒付的敞口</td>\n<td>卡充值、体验优先的消费钱包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算后到账（settle-then-credit）</td>\n<td>结算批次确认到账后才贷记</td>\n<td>有延迟（T+0 到 T+2）</td>\n<td>风险几乎为零，用户承担延迟</td>\n<td>大额充值、银行转账、OTC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（限额垫资）</td>\n<td>小额即时、超阈值转清算后</td>\n<td>分级可用</td>\n<td>可控敞口，需设阈值</td>\n<td>跨境电商钱包的默认做法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境卖家钱包几乎都落在「混合」这一格：渠道费用、汇率加价、拒付敞口三者叠加，纯垫资在高客单价类目上不可承受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"充值渠道类型与清算特征\">充值渠道类型与清算特征</h2><p>不同渠道的清算语义完全不同，这直接决定了在途账户的持有期和减值准备口径。国际卡组织（Visa、Mastercard）的授权与清算是两件事：授权只冻结额度，真正的资金通过清算网络的批量结算文件（settlement file）按 T+1 至 T+2 个工作日打款，且买家在清算完成后仍享有拒付（chargeback）权利，通常窗口为交易日后 120 天（部分争议类型更长，见各卡组织争议规则手册）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道类型</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>到账时效</th>\n<th>可否被撤销</th>\n<th>典型费用</th>\n<th>拒付敞口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>国际卡</td>\n<td>Visa / Mastercard / Amex</td>\n<td>T+1 ~ T+2 工作日</td>\n<td>是（chargeback，约 120 天窗口）</td>\n<td>交换费+网络费，综合约 1.5%–3%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地实时支付</td>\n<td>巴西 PIX（Banco Central do Brasil，2020 上线）、印度 UPI（NPCI）</td>\n<td>秒级、7×24</td>\n<td>极弱</td>\n<td>低（PIX 对个人近乎免费）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>即时转账法规区</td>\n<td>欧元区 SEPA Instant（EU 即时支付法规 (EU) 2024/886）</td>\n<td>10 秒内</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方钱包</td>\n<td>Alipay / WeChat Pay / GrabPay</td>\n<td>实时到账平台账户</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>约 0.6%–1.2%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行转账 / OTC</td>\n<td>电汇、SWIFT（2025 年 11 月起 CBPR+ 全面迁移 ISO 20022 报文）</td>\n<td>T+1 ~ T+5</td>\n<td>可撤回（汇款人申请）</td>\n<td>电汇费 + 中转行扣费</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先买后付 / 分期</td>\n<td>Klarna、Afterpay 类</td>\n<td>平台侧即时确认</td>\n<td>强（买方违约转平台）</td>\n<td>商户费约 3%–6%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个工程含义值得单独拎出来。第一，<strong>到账时效差异会让在途余额分布极度不均</strong>：卡渠道的在途余额常年挂着数日的交易额，实时支付渠道的在途余额几乎是零；因此风控的垫资额度必须按渠道分别设定，而不是给一个统一阈值。第二，<strong>SWIFT 电汇存在中转行扣费</strong>，汇出 10000 美元到账可能只有 9985 美元，这 15 美元既不是渠道手续费也不是汇率损失，必须走「在途差异」专用科目，否则对账时会被误判成短款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"待清算在途账户的复式记账\">待清算在途账户的复式记账</h2><p>一笔卡充值 100 美元、渠道综合费率 2.9%、固定费 0.30 美元的入账，会在三个时点产生三组分录。费率模型写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fee</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>amount</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> cap</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fee} = \\min\\big(\\text{amount} \\times r + c,\\ \\text{cap}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fee</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为比例费率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为固定费、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cap</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为封顶。以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 2.9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.9%</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = 0.30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span></span></span></span></span>、无封顶计，单笔费用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fee</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.029</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3.20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fee} = 100 \\times 0.029 + 0.30 = 3.20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fee</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.029</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.20</span></span></span></span></span> 美元；若用户承担费用（gross-up 模式），实付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.029</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P - (P \\times 0.029 + 0.30) = 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.029</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>103.19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx 103.19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">103.19</span></span></span></span></span> 美元——这是必须用公式反解而非加法的原因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>借方</th>\n<th>贷方</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>T0 授权成功</td>\n<td>应收渠道款（在途）100.00</td>\n<td>用户钱包余额 100.00</td>\n<td>平台立即垫资，用户可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T0 授权成功（用户承担手续费）</td>\n<td>应收渠道款（在途）103.19</td>\n<td>用户钱包余额 100.00 / 手续费收入 3.19</td>\n<td>gross-up 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T+2 结算到账</td>\n<td>银行存款 99.80 / 渠道手续费 3.20</td>\n<td>应收渠道款（在途）103.00</td>\n<td>净额结转，在途归零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结算到账时借方合计必须等于贷方合计，这是复式记账的硬约束，也是把「手续费」单列成费用科目的原因：若把手续费直接从在途余额里减掉让在途对不上，账就永远平不了。</p>\n<p>拒付准备金是这套模型里唯一需要主动估计的量。对即时垫资的卡充值，平台按渠道历史拒付率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 计提：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reserve</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>txn</mtext></munder><mtext>amount</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reserve} = \\sum_{\\text{txn}} \\text{amount} \\times d \\times w(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">txn</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是随拒付窗口剩余时间递减的权重。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 0.1%–1%，跨境高风险类目可达 2% 以上。准备金作为「预计负债」挂账，只影响平台可动用现金的口径，不改变用户在途明细的逐笔可核验性——这是它和「坏账准备」的区别：前者是概率估计，后者是已确认损失。</p>\n<p>这一节的账户结构并不是本 hub 独有，它与 <a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/\">多方账本账户模型</a> 中的账户树是同一棵树的资产侧分支，也与 <a href=\"../reconciliation-control-ops/\">对账与控制运营</a> 里的核销明细共享同一套在途台账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途状态机与异常分支\">在途状态机与异常分支</h2><p>在途不是一个静态余额，而是一条有明确终态的流水线。每笔充值订单都携带一个状态机，只有到达 <code>CLEARED</code> 或某个终态失败，这条在途明细才能从台账里销掉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S1[INITIATED&lt;br/&gt;创建充值单] --&gt; S2[AUTHORIZED&lt;br/&gt;渠道授权通过]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[CREDITED&lt;br/&gt;贷记用户余额]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4[SETTLING&lt;br/&gt;渠道结算中]&#10;    S4 --&gt; S5[CLEARED&lt;br/&gt;净额到账并核销]&#10;    S4 --&gt; S6[SETTLEMENT_SHORT&lt;br/&gt;短款/中转行扣费]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S7[REVERSED&lt;br/&gt;渠道撤销/授权过期]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S8[CHARGEBACK&lt;br/&gt;拒付在途回冲]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S9[FAILED&lt;br/&gt;授权失败即终态]&#10;    S6 --&gt; S5\">flowchart TD\n    S1[INITIATED&lt;br/&gt;创建充值单] --&gt; S2[AUTHORIZED&lt;br/&gt;渠道授权通过]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[CREDITED&lt;br/&gt;贷记用户余额]\n    S3 --&gt; S4[SETTLING&lt;br/&gt;渠道结算中]\n    S4 --&gt; S5[CLEARED&lt;br/&gt;净额到账并核销]\n    S4 --&gt; S6[SETTLEMENT_SHORT&lt;br/&gt;短款/中转行扣费]\n    S3 --&gt; S7[REVERSED&lt;br/&gt;渠道撤销/授权过期]\n    S5 --&gt; S8[CHARGEBACK&lt;br/&gt;拒付在途回冲]\n    S1 --&gt; S9[FAILED&lt;br/&gt;授权失败即终态]\n    S6 --&gt; S5</pre><p>异常分支的工程成本远高于正常路径。下表是跨境充值接入中真正会打断账本的失败模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>触发原因</th>\n<th>账本后果</th>\n<th>处置要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回调丢失</td>\n<td>渠道异步通知未送达或验签失败</td>\n<td>用户已扣款但平台未贷记</td>\n<td>主动查询（polling）兜底 + 定时对账补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复回调</td>\n<td>渠道重试同一通知</td>\n<td>重复贷记，凭空造钱</td>\n<td>以渠道交易号做幂等键，唯一约束拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分成功</td>\n<td>批量代收中部分笔失败</td>\n<td>在途余额与实际到账不符</td>\n<td>按笔核销，差额挂「未达账项」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短款</td>\n<td>中转行扣费、汇率差</td>\n<td>在途无法归零</td>\n<td>走差异科目，不摊到用户余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤销/过期</td>\n<td>授权后未在时限内清算</td>\n<td>已垫资的在途变成坏账</td>\n<td>撤销即回冲用户余额（可负余额）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒付</td>\n<td>买家发起争议</td>\n<td>在 +120 天窗口内反向冲销</td>\n<td>准备金吸收，必要时冻结账户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「可负余额」是一个容易被低估的设计点：如果用户已经用垫资余额下单并把钱提走，随后充值被撤销，回冲只能让钱包余额变成负数。账本必须允许负债侧出现负值并追踪其回收，而不是在应用层直接拒绝这笔记账——拒绝记账等于把坏账藏进内存里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程化接入要点\">工程化接入要点</h2><p><strong>幂等键要绑渠道交易号，不是订单号。</strong> 平台自己的订单号在重复提交场景下会变化，只有渠道返回的交易号（如卡组织的 ARN、PIX 的 End-to-End ID、UPI 的 RRN）能唯一标识一笔外部资金动作。幂等键必须落库加唯一约束，靠内存去重会在多实例部署下失效。</p>\n<p><strong>结算文件解析是一等公民。</strong> 卡组织和本地清算机构普遍提供批量结算文件，格式各异的定长文本、CSV 或 ISO 20022 XML。用临时脚本解析的团队通常在渠道调整字段顺序时静默错位；解析器应受版本控制，字段变更走代码评审。</p>\n<p><strong>合规闸门直接决定放行策略。</strong> 欧盟 PSD2 的强客户认证（SCA）与 3D Secure 2（EMVCo 规范）会让无 3DS 的充值进入拒付高风险池；欧元区即时支付在 (EU) 2024/886 下要求收款人验证（Verification of Payee）；卡数据一旦触碰就必须落在 PCI DSS v4.0.1（PCI SSC，2024 年发布，未来适用条款于 2025 年 3 月 31 日生效）范围内——最省事的做法是让卡号永不进入自己的系统，全程走渠道托管收银台。中国境内主体的充值业务还受《非银行支付机构监督管理条例》（2023 年 12 月公布，2024 年 5 月 1 日施行）约束，备付金集中存管会直接改变可动用在途资金的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>汇率加价要显式建模。</strong> 跨境充值的汇兑成本通常在中间价上加价 0.5%–2%，它和渠道手续费、拒付准备金一样是独立成本项。三者混成一个「综合费率」在财务上致命：准备金是概率负债，手续费是确定费用，汇率加价是价差损失，口径无法合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>充值的正确记账姿势是<strong>先借在途、后结转</strong>，绝不直接记「银行存款」，否则账本与真实资金流永远错位。</li>\n<li>在途账户是资产侧的「应收渠道款」，与用户钱包负债账户构成一对时间错配的两端；结转时手续费必须单列，才能保证借贷平衡。</li>\n<li>「何时给用户可用余额」是产品决策，垫资即时到账、清算后到账、限额混合三种策略对应完全不同的风控敞口，跨境电商钱包默认落在混合策略。</li>\n<li>渠道决定在途持有期：卡类 T+1~T+2 且带约 120 天拒付窗口，实时支付（PIX、UPI、SEPA Instant）几乎零在途，SWIFT 电汇还有中转行扣费带来的短款。</li>\n<li>状态机必须有明确的终态与异常分支；重复回调、回调丢失、短款、撤销、拒付五类异常里，只有幂等键绑渠道交易号才能真正防住重复入账。</li>\n<li>拒付准备金用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reserve</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>amount</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reserve} = \\sum \\text{amount} \\times d \\times w(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 计提，它是概率负债，与坏账准备本质不同。</li>\n<li>合规闸门（PCI DSS v4.0.1、PSD2 SCA / 3DS2、欧元区收款人验证、境内备付金存管）不是附加项，它约束充值放行策略与可动用在途资金的边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 的 <a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/\">多方账本账户模型</a> 定义了在途账户挂靠的账户树，<a href=\"../reconciliation-control-ops/\">对账与控制运营</a> 承接本文留下的结算批次核销与差异处置。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型","id":"充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"充值渠道类型与清算特征","id":"充值渠道类型与清算特征"},{"level":2,"text":"待清算在途账户的复式记账","id":"待清算在途账户的复式记账"},{"level":2,"text":"在途状态机与异常分支","id":"在途状态机与异常分支"},{"level":2,"text":"工程化接入要点","id":"工程化接入要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"子账本分级、可用/冻结/在途余额与账户状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/multiparty-ledger-account-model/subledger-balance-classes-freeze"},"next":{"title":"提现打款通道、风控冻结与放款机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/wallet-lifecycle-topup-withdraw/withdraw-payout-risk-hold-mechanism"}}